docs {
  ## GET /api/addresses

  Returns all saved delivery addresses for the authenticated customer.

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "addresses": [
      {
        "id": "...",
        "label": "Home",
        "street": "123 Tahrir Square",
        "city": "Cairo",
        "governorate": "Cairo",
        "postalCode": "11511",
        "isDefault": true
      }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
